WEBVTT


00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.290
Shashi... tea!


00:03:21.976 --> 00:03:22.943
Sapna!


00:03:25.046 --> 00:03:26.138
Give me my phone


00:03:26.247 --> 00:03:26.975
No...


00:03:27.081 --> 00:03:28.946
What no... have your breakfast first...


00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.310
Why don't you stop this white bread...


00:03:32.386 --> 00:03:33.978
why can't you get brown!


00:03:34.055 --> 00:03:35.147
Give it to me...


00:03:35.256 --> 00:03:37.486
l like white blue red... anything


00:03:37.925 --> 00:03:39.085
No Maaji...


00:03:39.326 --> 00:03:40.987
your porridge is ready


00:03:41.062 --> 00:03:43.121
Can l eat one parantha at least?


00:03:43.164 --> 00:03:46.258
Mom... you've had enough
paranthas all your life...


00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:47.231
it's time you had porridge now


00:03:47.301 --> 00:03:49.826
Shashi where's my parantha?
Hurry up please...


00:03:49.937 --> 00:03:51.962
Sagar... your bournvita


00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.831
lt's too white... make it brown!


00:03:55.009 --> 00:03:57.239
Everyone wants only brown brown...


00:04:01.415 --> 00:04:03.315
Mom look... thief!


00:04:04.351 --> 00:04:05.750
One sweet ladoo mom!


00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.253
Ok my darling... have one


00:04:07.321 --> 00:04:08.253
You're sick...


00:04:08.355 --> 00:04:10.823
you are going to
become a ladoo very soon


00:04:13.761 --> 00:04:15.251
Eat eat... eat more...


00:04:15.429 --> 00:04:17.090
you all are going to die very soon


00:04:17.164 --> 00:04:18.756
Sapna quiet


00:04:18.933 --> 00:04:20.423
you should eat what you like


00:04:21.035 --> 00:04:22.024
Exactly


00:04:22.103 --> 00:04:23.934
This new fad of brown bread...
egg whites...


00:04:24.004 --> 00:04:26.438
all started since you
joined this new dance class...


00:04:26.774 --> 00:04:29.106
that... that jhaaaz dance!


00:04:40.354 --> 00:04:41.343
What's so funny?


00:04:45.526 --> 00:04:48.256
l can't control it... it's too funny...


00:04:48.963 --> 00:04:53.093
Mama... say... what dance? What class?


00:04:53.801 --> 00:04:55.268
Which class?


00:04:56.537 --> 00:04:57.265
Eat your omelette


00:04:57.304 --> 00:05:00.034
Where's the omelette?
There's only toast and parantha here


00:05:03.544 --> 00:05:06.206
Come on Dad...
let's do the jhaaaz dance!


00:05:06.981 --> 00:05:09.040
Sapna... your omelette


00:05:09.316 --> 00:05:11.307
Mom it is not jhaaaz dance...


00:05:11.485 --> 00:05:13.476
it is jazz dance


00:05:35.075 --> 00:05:36.337
Jaazz...


00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.242
Jaazz...


00:05:41.982 --> 00:05:43.472
J... Jhazz... .


00:05:44.018 --> 00:05:46.418
Jaazzz... Jazz...


00:05:46.987 --> 00:05:49.478
Aye careful... pack properly...


00:05:49.924 --> 00:05:52.085
Ma'am... lt has to be gipt packed?


00:05:53.027 --> 00:05:55.222
Not 'gipt'... it's GlFT...


00:05:55.396 --> 00:05:56.590
Gipt... gipt...


00:05:57.998 --> 00:05:59.090
Never mind...


00:06:01.435 --> 00:06:03.835
Satish... is the car free?


00:06:04.004 --> 00:06:06.632
l have a lot of
orders for sweets today...


00:06:06.907 --> 00:06:09.341
Why do you need to go? Send Ramu...


00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.344
l need to go for a meeting...


00:06:17.284 --> 00:06:18.911
Nice to see you Shashi...


00:06:19.019 --> 00:06:20.919
The ladoos were
excellent the last time!


00:06:20.988 --> 00:06:22.182
Thank you


00:06:22.256 --> 00:06:23.484
Come in...


00:06:27.294 --> 00:06:29.091
Will need more ladoos
next week as well


00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.621
Give me one ladoo before she sees


00:06:38.539 --> 00:06:39.870
Next, Modern Colony


00:06:39.974 --> 00:06:40.668
Yes madam


00:06:44.879 --> 00:06:46.506
Hello... come in


00:06:46.547 --> 00:06:47.514
Sorry l'm a little late


00:06:47.548 --> 00:06:49.106
No problem at all


00:06:52.119 --> 00:06:54.553
Come... let's all taste the ladoos


00:07:00.961 --> 00:07:02.553
They are really excellent!


00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.928
You've done a great job!


00:07:08.269 --> 00:07:09.463
Excuse me


00:07:11.105 --> 00:07:12.129
Satish...


00:07:12.406 --> 00:07:14.067
the ladoos were a super hit today!


00:07:14.275 --> 00:07:15.299
Everyone loved...


00:07:15.409 --> 00:07:17.400
l'm busy right now...
can we talk later please?


00:07:25.486 --> 00:07:26.384
Sagar...


00:07:26.453 --> 00:07:28.478
how many times have l told you...
not to do this


00:07:32.159 --> 00:07:33.091
What are you doing!


00:07:34.261 --> 00:07:35.489
Where's Sapna?


00:07:35.729 --> 00:07:38.323
First do that Michael Jackson thing


00:07:38.732 --> 00:07:39.664
Tell me


00:07:39.967 --> 00:07:40.661
First do!


00:07:40.968 --> 00:07:44.404
First do! First do!


00:07:54.515 --> 00:07:55.743
Ok?


00:07:56.684 --> 00:07:58.117
Where's Sapna?


00:07:58.519 --> 00:08:01.545
She's gone to Rupal's house...
to study


00:08:02.156 --> 00:08:03.521
What exam?


00:08:04.491 --> 00:08:06.015
Must be some test vest...


00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.693
No test vest mama...
Cafe Coffee Day!


00:08:11.231 --> 00:08:13.028
You've let out the secret...


00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.397
what will Sapna do to you now?


00:08:14.668 --> 00:08:17.364
She's gone to Cafe Coffee Day
with her friends...


00:08:17.604 --> 00:08:19.697
she's having cold coffee


00:08:20.441 --> 00:08:22.341
Aren't you gotten angry?


00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:25.503
Not 'gotten'... getting...


00:08:25.779 --> 00:08:27.610
l am not getting angry...


00:08:28.082 --> 00:08:29.344
what to do?


00:08:30.351 --> 00:08:32.581
She's worn a really short skirt...


00:08:32.753 --> 00:08:34.448
At least she has worn a skirt!


00:08:34.621 --> 00:08:36.384
There are boys with her too!


00:08:36.757 --> 00:08:38.247
Lucky boys!


00:08:38.459 --> 00:08:40.256
You don't have a problem
with any of this?


00:08:40.294 --> 00:08:42.592
l can't hear anything


00:08:47.267 --> 00:08:48.256
What?


00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:52.637
There's some cold coffee
on your skirt


00:08:54.641 --> 00:08:55.630
Where have you been?


00:08:57.077 --> 00:08:57.805
Studying


00:08:58.078 --> 00:08:58.772
With whom?


00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:00.640
With Rupal


00:09:01.348 --> 00:09:02.679
Can't you study at home?


00:09:04.451 --> 00:09:06.043
You think you can teach me...


00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.482
English Literature?


00:09:28.208 --> 00:09:31.075
Wow... great curry!


00:09:32.713 --> 00:09:36.479
Thank god l didn't eat out...


00:09:38.752 --> 00:09:40.481
Give me that chilly pickle...


00:09:44.591 --> 00:09:45.683
Shashi...


00:09:47.327 --> 00:09:50.160
you should stop making
those ladoos vadoos


00:09:52.366 --> 00:09:53.765
l have just one passion...


00:09:54.101 --> 00:09:55.500
you want me to give that up too?


00:09:58.338 --> 00:09:59.236
Then give me...


00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.731
one Shashi Special Ladoo!


00:10:12.453 --> 00:10:14.421
Only l should eat your food...


00:10:14.555 --> 00:10:16.284
why should others enjoy it?


00:10:16.623 --> 00:10:18.591
lf l didn't cook well...


00:10:19.526 --> 00:10:21.221
. . you wouldn't even
bother to come home, right?


00:10:21.462 --> 00:10:24.124
l've important
meetings to attend to...


00:10:24.231 --> 00:10:25.721
these talks take time


00:10:27.534 --> 00:10:30.298
Talking to me is not important right?


00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.130
Oh l forget...


00:10:35.642 --> 00:10:38.440
'important talks'
happen only in English


00:10:49.323 --> 00:10:51.416
Why waste time talking?


00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:00.897
No! No! No!


00:11:01.301 --> 00:11:03.701
Dad how could you do this? Please!


00:11:05.239 --> 00:11:06.331
Sapna...


00:11:07.741 --> 00:11:09.231
What happened?


00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:10.899
Hello


00:11:12.546 --> 00:11:13.478
Hello


00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.241
Satish... What happened?


00:11:15.349 --> 00:11:16.577
Why is Sapna yelling?


00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.244
Shashi... l won't be able to go
to the PTA meeting


00:11:21.255 --> 00:11:22.586
How can you do this?


00:11:23.357 --> 00:11:24.585
No wonder she is angry...


00:11:24.725 --> 00:11:27.421
Told her you will go with her...


00:11:27.494 --> 00:11:28.426
Me?


00:11:29.563 --> 00:11:30.587
How can l...


00:11:30.697 --> 00:11:32.824
What do you mean by how?
Aren't you a parent too?


00:11:33.433 --> 00:11:36.368
What will l say there?


00:11:36.436 --> 00:11:37.368
Don't be silly Shashi...


00:11:37.437 --> 00:11:38.597
you're not going into a jungle...
it's a school...


00:11:38.705 --> 00:11:39.603
they're not going to eat you up


00:11:39.706 --> 00:11:41.230
Now l have to go... bye


00:11:46.513 --> 00:11:47.605
l will come with you...


00:11:47.714 --> 00:11:48.578
There is no need...


00:11:48.615 --> 00:11:51.743
l will tell them you're
ill and Dad's not in town


00:11:52.252 --> 00:11:54.550
Why ill? Tell them l'm dead


00:11:54.788 --> 00:11:56.346
Don't be dramatic mom


00:11:56.957 --> 00:11:58.925
Do you even know what PTA means?


00:11:59.726 --> 00:12:00.693
No...


00:12:01.295 --> 00:12:03.286
l may not know the meaning of PTA...


00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.760
but l certainly know
the meaning of a parent


00:12:06.533 --> 00:12:08.626
Now before l get really angry...


00:12:08.769 --> 00:12:09.701
go get ready


00:12:17.878 --> 00:12:21.871
Which one is your classroom?
7 A... this one?


00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:25.379
Which one is your seat?


00:12:25.652 --> 00:12:27.984
Not seat... desk... second last row


00:12:28.388 --> 00:12:29.821
You sit so far back?


00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.448
lt doesn't make a difference...
come on...


00:12:31.525 --> 00:12:32.617
That's really far back...


00:12:36.463 --> 00:12:37.020
Hi Sapna...


00:12:37.297 --> 00:12:37.956
Hi Rupal!


00:12:38.398 --> 00:12:40.332
Hello hello!


00:12:40.634 --> 00:12:41.658
l'm Neelam...


00:12:41.735 --> 00:12:44.033
commonly known as
Rupal's mother these days


00:12:44.538 --> 00:12:47.336
l'm... Sapna mother... Shashi


00:12:47.407 --> 00:12:49.034
How nice to meet you Shashi


00:12:49.676 --> 00:12:51.007
But l have a bone to pick with you


00:12:51.545 --> 00:12:53.809
Every time that Rupal
comes to eat at your house


00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:55.347
she comes back home and tells me


00:12:55.415 --> 00:12:56.973
l have to learn how to cook from you


00:12:57.918 --> 00:12:59.909
No aunty... even your food is...


00:13:00.554 --> 00:13:01.418
fantabulous!


00:13:01.488 --> 00:13:02.921
What a sweet little liar


00:13:03.457 --> 00:13:05.618
But you must invite
me home soon Shashi...


00:13:05.826 --> 00:13:08.761
then you and l can sit and
gossip about these Siamese twins


00:13:08.829 --> 00:13:09.955
Yes... yes aunty...


00:13:09.997 --> 00:13:11.487
please come... anytime!


00:13:12.466 --> 00:13:15.458
Mom, you wanted to use the loo right?


00:13:15.802 --> 00:13:16.996
So nice to meet you Shashi


00:13:17.304 --> 00:13:18.464
Bye... see you soon.


00:13:21.742 --> 00:13:22.572
What loo?


00:13:22.643 --> 00:13:23.667
Come come come...


00:13:23.777 --> 00:13:25.836
please sit inside...
l'll be just a minute...


00:13:27.614 --> 00:13:29.411
ls this your English teacher?


00:13:29.483 --> 00:13:32.008
Yes... Father Vincent...
my class teacher...


00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:34.980
Yes Sapna...


00:13:35.422 --> 00:13:36.514
How are you?


00:13:36.623 --> 00:13:37.851
Mrs. Godbole right?


00:13:37.958 --> 00:13:39.084
Pleasure to meet you


00:13:39.626 --> 00:13:40.786
How's Mr. Godbole?


00:13:40.961 --> 00:13:42.326
Fine... very fine


00:13:44.531 --> 00:13:45.498
So... Sapna...


00:13:45.532 --> 00:13:46.692
what should we start with?


00:13:48.702 --> 00:13:51.364
As l had discussed with
Mr. Godbole at the last PTA...


00:13:51.605 --> 00:13:53.368
Sapna's performance
continues to be excellent...


00:13:53.473 --> 00:13:55.373
Sir... sorry... father...


00:13:57.778 --> 00:13:59.643
my English not good


00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.610
lf you don't mind...


00:14:02.683 --> 00:14:05.413
... can we talk in Hindi?


00:14:09.022 --> 00:14:10.455
Of course Mrs. Godbole...


00:14:10.957 --> 00:14:12.447
Hindi is our national Language...


00:14:12.559 --> 00:14:14.424
we should all speak in it...


00:14:14.628 --> 00:14:16.619
but... my Hindi not very good...


00:14:16.797 --> 00:14:17.923
is that okay?


00:14:18.098 --> 00:14:19.360
No problem!


00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.097
l am from Kottayam district you see...


00:14:21.368 --> 00:14:23.632
Kottayam... that's in Kerala right?


00:14:24.371 --> 00:14:26.066
lt's famous for its
banana wafers right?


00:14:26.139 --> 00:14:28.073
Do you like them?


00:14:28.141 --> 00:14:29.472
Very much!


00:14:29.543 --> 00:14:30.737
Next time l go l...


00:14:30.811 --> 00:14:33.075
l'll bring back a big
packet of chips for you


00:14:35.982 --> 00:14:39.383
ls she doing well in her studies?


00:14:39.453 --> 00:14:39.976
Of course...


00:14:40.087 --> 00:14:42.578
she is one of the top
5 students of our class


00:14:42.823 --> 00:14:44.051
She could rank first...


00:14:44.124 --> 00:14:46.888
if she showed more interest in Physics


00:14:47.394 --> 00:14:49.658
But is her English good?


00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:51.095
Her English is excellent


00:14:52.466 --> 00:14:54.832
Mrs. Godbole...
she is one of our brightest students


00:14:56.737 --> 00:14:59.001
But is she respectful?


00:14:59.139 --> 00:15:01.073
Does everyone like her?


00:15:01.408 --> 00:15:03.899
Sapna... you haven't told
your mum about your fan club?


00:15:05.412 --> 00:15:09.041
Bu Mrs. Godbole,
l wanted to talk to you about...


00:15:09.082 --> 00:15:11.016
... this inter-school quiz competition


00:15:11.752 --> 00:15:13.014
Sapna has been chosen...


00:15:13.553 --> 00:15:15.885
Sapna has 'choosen' for the school...


00:15:16.423 --> 00:15:18.084
been 'choosed'...


00:15:18.692 --> 00:15:20.023
Has been chosen!


00:15:20.093 --> 00:15:22.186
l warned you about my Hindi


00:15:23.663 --> 00:15:27.656
She will need to stay back
an extra hour in school...


00:15:28.001 --> 00:15:28.899
for practice sessions...


00:15:29.069 --> 00:15:31.594
Sir... l have already
spoken to my dad about this...


00:15:31.705 --> 00:15:32.694
and there is no problem


00:15:32.773 --> 00:15:34.741
Yes but you haven't
spoken to your mum...


00:15:34.775 --> 00:15:35.935
Ma'am, l need your permission please


00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:37.909
Not a problem father...


00:15:37.944 --> 00:15:40.071
our school must win


00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:44.446
Although the Coffee Day
business will suffer a bit


00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:47.780
Thank you Mrs. Godbole...


00:15:47.854 --> 00:15:50.015
l'll see you at the next PTA meeting?


00:16:02.102 --> 00:16:04.036
And don't forget the banana chips


00:16:04.137 --> 00:16:05.934
Of course not...


00:16:06.006 --> 00:16:07.473
Thank you sir


00:16:14.214 --> 00:16:15.681
Everything went well right?


00:16:16.216 --> 00:16:17.547
Banana chips!


00:16:17.851 --> 00:16:19.716
ls Father Vincent your uncle?


00:16:21.488 --> 00:16:23.820
Father Vincent was so kind...


00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:25.881
... so polite...


00:16:27.227 --> 00:16:29.718
he said something in jest...


00:16:29.796 --> 00:16:32.492
and l went along with it


00:16:32.833 --> 00:16:34.892
He didn't seem to mind at all...


00:16:35.569 --> 00:16:39.505
he made me feel so comfortable...


00:16:39.739 --> 00:16:41.070
by talking in Hindi


00:16:41.508 --> 00:16:43.908
And you made him
feel so uncomfortable...


00:16:43.977 --> 00:16:45.171
... by talking in Hindi


00:16:45.245 --> 00:16:46.837
''ls Sapna a good girl...


00:16:46.913 --> 00:16:48.710
does everyone love her''...


00:16:49.916 --> 00:16:53.215
And why joke about Cafe Coffee Day...


00:16:53.253 --> 00:16:54.811
Dad should have been there...


00:16:55.255 --> 00:16:56.722
and you were talking in Hindi...


00:16:56.756 --> 00:16:58.155
even to Rupal's mother


00:16:58.225 --> 00:17:00.159
Each time l had to answer for you


00:17:17.978 --> 00:17:19.002
What happened?


00:17:20.013 --> 00:17:21.275
Failed her exams?


00:17:21.515 --> 00:17:22.846
l'm the one who's failed


00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.748
Meaning?


00:17:24.818 --> 00:17:26.809
l have embarrassed her today


00:17:28.989 --> 00:17:33.016
All teenagers feel their mom
and dad are an embarrassment


00:17:33.326 --> 00:17:34.850
Not mom and dad...


00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.090
just mom


00:17:40.667 --> 00:17:42.134
Why are you so upset?


00:17:42.936 --> 00:17:44.267
Tell me...


00:17:44.838 --> 00:17:46.305
why did you marry me?


00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:49.331
What can l say...
one look at you and l was hooked!


00:17:49.709 --> 00:17:51.176
lsn't there any water?


00:17:51.978 --> 00:17:54.003
Why didn't you marry a modern woman?


00:17:54.714 --> 00:17:57.706
lf l gave it so much thought
why would l get married at all...


00:17:59.619 --> 00:18:02.884
lt's a joke Shashi... come on...


00:18:05.091 --> 00:18:07.252
What's come over you?


00:18:07.894 --> 00:18:09.691
No matter how hard l try...


00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:11.859
l just can't seem to please anyone


00:18:13.967 --> 00:18:15.127
Sapna's just a child


00:18:16.236 --> 00:18:17.294
And you?


00:18:20.373 --> 00:18:21.305
Hello...


00:18:21.641 --> 00:18:22.699
Manu!


00:18:23.076 --> 00:18:24.805
Hi... how are you?


00:18:25.145 --> 00:18:28.637
Yes l know you
sisters chat regularly...


00:18:28.748 --> 00:18:30.147
but what about me


00:18:30.784 --> 00:18:32.081
So how is New York?


00:18:33.153 --> 00:18:34.313
When are you coming to lndia?


00:18:35.322 --> 00:18:37.222
Last time when you
came along with Radha...


00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:39.383
what a wonderful time we had


00:18:40.393 --> 00:18:41.724
So how is...


00:18:43.229 --> 00:18:44.253
Meera... ?


00:18:45.999 --> 00:18:47.159
What!


00:18:47.834 --> 00:18:49.165
The date's been fixed?


00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:52.161
Wedding in New York!


00:18:53.406 --> 00:18:54.304
Speak to Shashi...


00:18:54.341 --> 00:18:55.968
l can't believe it...


00:18:56.009 --> 00:18:58.102
We're going to New York!


00:18:58.278 --> 00:19:00.746
Can't sleep... so much noise...


00:19:00.814 --> 00:19:02.179
Aye dumbo... wake up...


00:19:02.248 --> 00:19:03.738
we're going to New York!


00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:06.080
Manu aunty is
sending tickets for us...


00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:08.251
so sweet of her... right mom?


00:19:11.057 --> 00:19:12.354
Sorry mom...


00:19:13.259 --> 00:19:14.749
forget about it please...


00:19:15.996 --> 00:19:17.361
just forget it...


00:19:17.764 --> 00:19:19.095
we are going to New York!


00:19:19.165 --> 00:19:20.257
Not going to school?


00:19:22.035 --> 00:19:23.900
Cousin Meera is getting married


00:19:24.104 --> 00:19:26.868
To an American in New York...
how cool!


00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.066
lt must be very cold there


00:19:28.108 --> 00:19:30.235
Mom... even it if was hot,
you couldn't come


00:19:30.276 --> 00:19:31.038
Why?


00:19:31.111 --> 00:19:32.942
You don't have a passport


00:19:33.413 --> 00:19:34.744
You have to make a passport?


00:19:34.781 --> 00:19:36.749
Yes you have to...


00:19:36.916 --> 00:19:39.077
Tomorrow l'll start
the visa procedures...


00:19:39.119 --> 00:19:41.679
first is yours...
since you need to leave before us


00:19:41.755 --> 00:19:42.722
And us?


00:19:42.856 --> 00:19:43.880
We will go later


00:19:43.957 --> 00:19:44.946
Why?


00:19:45.291 --> 00:19:47.054
l've told you...


00:19:47.293 --> 00:19:49.056
l don't want to go alone


00:19:49.229 --> 00:19:51.390
l'll come with you...


00:19:51.464 --> 00:19:52.954
on the plane


00:19:53.033 --> 00:19:54.762
What's this alone valone?


00:19:54.801 --> 00:19:57.770
You, Sagar and me
will travel together


00:19:58.104 --> 00:19:59.298
We will have great fun...


00:19:59.372 --> 00:20:00.737
let mummy go ahead


00:20:00.807 --> 00:20:03.867
She needs to help
Manu aunty with the wedding...


00:20:03.943 --> 00:20:04.967
really boring work


00:20:05.078 --> 00:20:07.137
We'll join them
later and just have fun


00:20:07.814 --> 00:20:09.145
What... no Dad!


00:20:09.249 --> 00:20:10.944
What about your quiz competition?


00:20:11.151 --> 00:20:12.379
You want to let your team down?


00:20:12.452 --> 00:20:14.317
l don't have any quiz competition


00:20:14.387 --> 00:20:16.048
l can go with mummy


00:20:16.122 --> 00:20:17.953
Fine... you'll be
thrown out of school...


00:20:17.991 --> 00:20:19.424
... you can sit at home and make ladoos


00:20:32.305 --> 00:20:32.999
What?


00:20:34.908 --> 00:20:36.398
l've never travelled alone...


00:20:36.509 --> 00:20:37.339
how will l manage?


00:20:37.444 --> 00:20:38.775
What alone!


00:20:39.012 --> 00:20:41.139
A hundred people will be
with you on the flight


00:20:44.517 --> 00:20:45.449
Let me take Sagar...


00:20:45.518 --> 00:20:46.951
No it's not a good idea...


00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:48.954
you won't be able to manage


00:20:49.155 --> 00:20:50.349
Don't l do it here?


00:20:50.423 --> 00:20:52.823
But that's America...
it's a foreign land...


00:20:52.859 --> 00:20:54.827
you can't even speak English well


00:21:00.467 --> 00:21:01.832
Will you be happy...


00:21:02.535 --> 00:21:04.059
3 weeks without me?


00:21:26.025 --> 00:21:28.220
Shashi lf l was you...


00:21:28.561 --> 00:21:31.428
l would be at the airport right now


00:21:33.466 --> 00:21:36.264
Maaji... how do l go?


00:21:36.803 --> 00:21:38.395
lt's a matter of a few days...


00:21:38.538 --> 00:21:40.233
everyone will join you anyway


00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.473
She is your only sister...


00:21:42.976 --> 00:21:44.307
she's all alone there...


00:21:44.544 --> 00:21:46.239
first wedding in the family...


00:21:46.946 --> 00:21:48.971
who else will she turn to for help?


00:21:52.318 --> 00:21:53.250
And l'm here anyway...


00:21:56.589 --> 00:21:58.113
Problem?


00:21:58.324 --> 00:22:01.088
Yes... a really big problem


00:22:02.128 --> 00:22:04.562
Will you manage without me?


00:22:05.031 --> 00:22:06.828
Yes... few Beyblades...


00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.128
that Tron game...


00:22:08.201 --> 00:22:09.225
Ben 10...


00:22:09.335 --> 00:22:10.825
and many Hot Wheels cars...


00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:12.961
if l get all this l will manage


00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:18.138
And how do you do that thing?


00:22:33.426 --> 00:22:36.589
O my dear...
my heart doesn't beat without you


00:22:36.863 --> 00:22:39.058
My heart... it feels a twitch


00:22:39.365 --> 00:22:43.096
How do l go to a foreign land?


00:22:43.403 --> 00:22:45.928
My heart...


00:22:46.072 --> 00:22:48.438
My heart trembles... quivers


00:22:48.508 --> 00:22:51.204
l am afraid


00:22:54.881 --> 00:22:58.078
O my dear...
my heart doesn't beat without you


00:22:58.184 --> 00:23:00.277
My heart... it feels a twitch


00:23:00.587 --> 00:23:05.354
How do l go to a foreign land?


00:23:35.555 --> 00:23:38.547
Do you embrace
all your colleagues so fondly?


00:23:39.058 --> 00:23:40.491
lt was a hug Shashi


00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:43.060
Are the two of you very close?


00:23:43.897 --> 00:23:45.455
That's just a way of saying hello...


00:23:45.565 --> 00:23:47.192
it doesn't mean we are close


00:23:47.233 --> 00:23:49.201
Everybody hugs... it's normal!


00:23:49.235 --> 00:23:51.169
We are close right...


00:23:51.504 --> 00:23:54.064
maybe that's why we never hug!


00:23:55.575 --> 00:23:58.237
Sometimes my heart beats faster


00:23:58.478 --> 00:24:00.639
My left eye flickers


00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:04.946
Will you forget me... l wonder


00:24:05.618 --> 00:24:08.246
l know you through and through


00:24:08.588 --> 00:24:10.715
l know you more than you


00:24:11.124 --> 00:24:14.651
Will your eye wander... l wonder


00:24:16.329 --> 00:24:17.626
So ma'am... what do you do?


00:24:19.265 --> 00:24:21.233
Making... making snacks...


00:24:21.334 --> 00:24:22.164
Snacks?


00:24:22.402 --> 00:24:24.097
You know you are not
allowed to bring food articles


00:24:24.170 --> 00:24:25.728
into the United States of America?


00:24:27.140 --> 00:24:28.300
Food... food articles...


00:24:29.075 --> 00:24:31.600
My English... weak...


00:24:32.145 --> 00:24:33.612
So ma'am how will you
manage in our country...


00:24:33.680 --> 00:24:35.170
if you don't know English?


00:24:35.615 --> 00:24:38.106
Like you are managing in our
country without knowing Hindi!


00:24:48.361 --> 00:24:51.421
These nights these days


00:24:52.031 --> 00:24:54.329
Your words and ways


00:24:54.434 --> 00:24:58.131
l will miss them so...


00:24:59.105 --> 00:25:01.471
Your slights and spite


00:25:02.041 --> 00:25:04.236
The way you hold me tight


00:25:04.444 --> 00:25:08.175
Makes me pine for more...


00:25:10.683 --> 00:25:13.117
Why don't you stop me?


00:25:13.286 --> 00:25:15.345
O don't let me go!


00:25:15.621 --> 00:25:18.351
One mention of you...


00:25:18.458 --> 00:25:21.256
l worry... l'm wary...
l think of you...


00:25:21.361 --> 00:25:23.420
Mama come fast... it's late!


00:25:25.598 --> 00:25:28.089
My heart...


00:25:28.234 --> 00:25:30.566
My heart trembles... quivers


00:25:30.636 --> 00:25:33.400
l am afraid


00:25:40.580 --> 00:25:41.308
Mom...


00:25:41.414 --> 00:25:44.247
not possible to say goodbye
without crying in lndia, right?


00:25:45.318 --> 00:25:47.149
She's crying so much


00:25:54.460 --> 00:25:55.324
Shashi...


00:25:55.495 --> 00:25:57.656
when the immigration guys ask you...


00:25:58.331 --> 00:25:59.662
''What is the purpose of your visit?''


00:25:59.799 --> 00:26:01.289
what will you say?


00:26:02.068 --> 00:26:05.731
''l am going to sister's
place to attend wedding''


00:26:06.239 --> 00:26:07.228
Good!


00:26:07.373 --> 00:26:10.069
And ''What's the duration of
your stay?''


00:26:11.344 --> 00:26:12.504
l am going to...


00:26:12.578 --> 00:26:15.069
l am going to stay in
my sister's place...


00:26:16.582 --> 00:26:18.743
Looks like you'll be sent right back!


00:26:19.085 --> 00:26:19.414
Why?


00:26:19.552 --> 00:26:21.417
Didn't l tell you... DURATlON!


00:26:21.554 --> 00:26:22.543
DURATlON!


00:26:22.588 --> 00:26:24.419
Sorry sorry...


00:26:24.724 --> 00:26:26.715
5 weeks...


00:26:29.228 --> 00:26:30.252
Let's go!


00:26:36.335 --> 00:26:37.495
What are you doing?


00:26:37.770 --> 00:26:40.762
lf l hug it's a problem,
if l don't it's a problem!


00:26:51.884 --> 00:26:53.374
New York...


00:26:55.254 --> 00:26:56.448
window seat?


00:26:58.424 --> 00:27:00.221
Don't they have this form in Hindi?


00:27:00.293 --> 00:27:02.193
l can fill it out for you


00:27:08.367 --> 00:27:09.527
America?


00:27:09.702 --> 00:27:12.262
Yes... my niece is getting married


00:27:14.874 --> 00:27:16.171
All the best


00:27:28.221 --> 00:27:28.812
Open your bag...


00:27:28.888 --> 00:27:30.219
no water allowed


00:27:30.823 --> 00:27:32.518
But it's a long journey...


00:27:32.625 --> 00:27:33.819
You will get water inside


00:27:33.893 --> 00:27:35.861
Eatables are not allowed either


00:27:37.530 --> 00:27:38.394
Just one box?


00:27:38.464 --> 00:27:39.829
Sorry ma'am...


00:27:41.234 --> 00:27:42.292
Alright?


00:27:45.571 --> 00:27:48.734
Satish... they took away
my water bottle...


00:27:50.643 --> 00:27:52.167
l'm inside the plane...


00:27:52.912 --> 00:27:54.243
is Sapna asleep?


00:27:54.480 --> 00:27:55.310
Excuse me ma'am...


00:27:55.381 --> 00:27:56.905
can you please turn
off your cell phone


00:27:57.183 --> 00:27:57.512
Sorry


00:27:57.583 --> 00:27:59.210
No it's fine... you can keep it


00:28:22.909 --> 00:28:23.671
Water...


00:28:24.243 --> 00:28:25.608
You can ring the bell


00:28:30.583 --> 00:28:32.574
Can you get the lady
a glass of water please?


00:28:35.254 --> 00:28:37.984
The next 18 hours...
this button is at your service


00:28:58.377 --> 00:28:59.469
You can...


00:28:59.812 --> 00:29:01.871
confidently, definitely, surely


00:29:02.348 --> 00:29:03.781
absolutely shamelessly


00:29:03.849 --> 00:29:05.510
press this button again and again


00:29:10.556 --> 00:29:12.581
See... magic!


00:29:15.795 --> 00:29:17.695
Ma'am, veg or non veg?


00:29:21.734 --> 00:29:22.962
Veg... veg...


00:29:25.037 --> 00:29:28.473
Would you like some
Chardonnay or Merlot with your meal?


00:29:32.612 --> 00:29:34.807
One glass of wine is good for health


00:29:39.585 --> 00:29:40.574
Cheers!


00:29:56.669 --> 00:29:59.399
lt's good stuff


00:30:33.039 --> 00:30:34.028
What's the matter?


00:30:35.341 --> 00:30:36.706
Just one Hindi movie here...


00:30:37.510 --> 00:30:38.841
l've seen it on TV


00:30:39.712 --> 00:30:41.646
And 50 English channels...


00:30:46.485 --> 00:30:47.383
Here... look...


00:30:49.655 --> 00:30:50.644
same picture...


00:30:50.723 --> 00:30:52.020
same film...


00:30:52.124 --> 00:30:53.648
there's no need for that


00:30:56.562 --> 00:31:00.555
l need to talk to my father


00:31:01.534 --> 00:31:03.900
Captain, who bombed the train


00:31:04.770 --> 00:31:07.466
l don't know who bombed the train


00:31:08.574 --> 00:31:10.064
Then go back and try again


00:31:11.977 --> 00:31:13.444
No! No! No!


00:31:16.615 --> 00:31:18.606
Stop this cow dung...


00:31:20.086 --> 00:31:21.815
Let's start with the bomb...


00:31:21.987 --> 00:31:23.420
Excuse me...


00:31:23.889 --> 00:31:25.151
are you a terrorist?


00:31:25.725 --> 00:31:27.454
We are trying to sleep here...


00:31:31.897 --> 00:31:34.991
l will go but...


00:32:00.793 --> 00:32:05.162
l am going to sister's
place to attend wedding...


00:32:07.032 --> 00:32:07.999
Passport please...


00:32:10.836 --> 00:32:12.428
lmmigration form...


00:32:14.874 --> 00:32:16.432
Please look into the camera ma'am


00:32:17.109 --> 00:32:18.599
Please look into the camera...


00:32:21.747 --> 00:32:24.113
What is the purpose of your
visit to the United States?


00:32:24.450 --> 00:32:25.075
What?


00:32:25.184 --> 00:32:28.119
What... is... the... purpose... of...
your... visit... to the United States?


00:32:28.220 --> 00:32:30.211
My sister is attending my wedding


00:32:31.023 --> 00:32:31.955
What?


00:32:37.530 --> 00:32:39.020
Ah you're here to attend a wedding!


00:32:39.231 --> 00:32:40.061
Yes


00:32:41.967 --> 00:32:42.934
Thank you


00:32:47.473 --> 00:32:49.941
What is the purpose...
- To help the United States of America


00:32:50.209 --> 00:32:51.471
Sorry?


00:32:51.644 --> 00:32:52.770
Yeah... you know...


00:32:52.878 --> 00:32:53.742
to spend some dollars...


00:32:53.813 --> 00:32:55.212
help recover your economy


00:32:55.948 --> 00:32:57.813
You don't want it? l can go back...


00:32:58.584 --> 00:33:01.781
l am going to sister's
place to attend wedding!


00:33:02.087 --> 00:33:04.681
How dumb am l...
- Listen...


00:33:05.891 --> 00:33:07.859
Don't let these people scare you...


00:33:08.027 --> 00:33:09.824
it's time for them to get scared of us


00:33:10.229 --> 00:33:11.992
This is your first trip to the US...


00:33:12.731 --> 00:33:15.029
and first times happen only once


00:33:15.501 --> 00:33:17.969
Every first experience is special...


00:33:18.070 --> 00:33:19.833
so enjoy...


00:33:20.873 --> 00:33:23.740
surely, definitely, confidently!


00:33:24.877 --> 00:33:25.901
All the best!


00:33:31.250 --> 00:33:32.911
Shashi aunty!


00:33:42.261 --> 00:33:43.751
Mom... you've reached?


00:33:43.996 --> 00:33:45.554
l'm in the car!


00:33:45.598 --> 00:33:46.530
How are you?


00:33:46.599 --> 00:33:48.089
The kids aren't
troubling you l hope...


00:33:48.200 --> 00:33:49.098
Hi mama!


00:33:49.268 --> 00:33:50.166
Sagar!


00:33:55.207 --> 00:33:55.764
Aunty...


00:33:55.841 --> 00:33:57.934
no more worrying about Sapna,
Sagar and uncle...


00:33:58.043 --> 00:34:00.568
you're in New York...
we're going to have a blast!


00:34:00.779 --> 00:34:03.577
New York has really
tall buildings, right?


00:34:03.682 --> 00:34:04.580
Saw them from the plane...


00:34:04.683 --> 00:34:06.150
Shashi... that's Manhattan...


00:34:06.652 --> 00:34:09.018
Man... hat... . tan?


00:34:09.121 --> 00:34:10.110
'Man' means...


00:34:10.189 --> 00:34:11.247
aadmi...


00:34:11.991 --> 00:34:12.980
'Hat'... means


00:34:13.025 --> 00:34:13.855
topi


00:34:13.959 --> 00:34:16.587
Mom... what's 'tan' in Hindi?


00:34:17.596 --> 00:34:19.086
'Tan'... means...


00:34:19.198 --> 00:34:20.165
dhoop ki chaap!


00:34:20.199 --> 00:34:23.100
Aadmi... topi... dhoop ki chaap...


00:34:23.168 --> 00:34:25.295
Manhattan! Tomorrow l'll take you


00:34:27.606 --> 00:34:29.005
Thank you Shashi...


00:34:30.109 --> 00:34:31.303
Thank you... ?


00:34:31.944 --> 00:34:33.775
Ok... welcome


00:34:35.881 --> 00:34:39.180
l know it wasn't
easy for you to come...


00:34:40.553 --> 00:34:42.612
but who do l have except you


00:34:44.890 --> 00:34:47.222
lt's been 10 years
since Anil passed away


00:34:48.360 --> 00:34:51.056
l really miss him...


00:34:53.165 --> 00:34:54.325
selfish fellow!


00:34:55.234 --> 00:34:57.862
l have to do everything on my own now


00:34:58.137 --> 00:34:59.195
Manu...


00:35:00.072 --> 00:35:03.906
l look at you and l feel so proud...


00:35:05.044 --> 00:35:07.706
to think of where we started...
and where you are now!


00:35:10.282 --> 00:35:12.250
Remember our Hindi medium school?


00:35:14.720 --> 00:35:16.813
We couldn't speak a
single word of English...


00:35:16.889 --> 00:35:19.050
not a word!


00:35:21.226 --> 00:35:22.386
And look at you now...


00:35:22.895 --> 00:35:25.261
you have a great
career here in America...


00:35:25.898 --> 00:35:27.832
taken care of 2 girls all by yourself


00:35:30.669 --> 00:35:32.159
Anil... Anil...


00:35:32.671 --> 00:35:35.003
lf he hadn't motivated me...


00:35:35.407 --> 00:35:36.999
l would have remained the same


00:35:37.676 --> 00:35:39.667
l miss him so terribly...


00:35:40.913 --> 00:35:42.312
but thank god you're here!


00:35:43.849 --> 00:35:47.341
Aunty this is gorgeous!


00:35:47.653 --> 00:35:49.018
Wonderful choice Shashi!


00:35:49.121 --> 00:35:52.181
Hat... man... with a tan


00:35:52.257 --> 00:35:55.693
Manhattan


00:35:56.662 --> 00:35:59.756
Touching heaven, oh my god!


00:35:59.832 --> 00:36:03.063
Manhattan.


00:36:03.402 --> 00:36:06.701
New avenues of joy


00:36:07.072 --> 00:36:10.166
Shops full of dreams


00:36:10.242 --> 00:36:14.679
A new surprise, at every stop


00:36:15.014 --> 00:36:16.845
To your left is Prada


00:36:16.915 --> 00:36:18.678
To your right is Zara


00:36:18.751 --> 00:36:22.243
Giorgio Armani,
Thank God it's Friday!


00:36:22.354 --> 00:36:24.083
Gucci and Versace,


00:36:24.123 --> 00:36:26.023
Jimmy Choo, Givenchy,


00:36:26.091 --> 00:36:29.254
Diesel, Dior, Hokey Pokey,
Gap and Bloomingdale


00:36:29.294 --> 00:36:32.957
Louis Vuitton


00:36:33.098 --> 00:36:36.226
Moschino


00:36:36.769 --> 00:36:40.899
Valentino...


00:36:45.978 --> 00:36:49.243
So much to say yet speechless


00:36:49.481 --> 00:36:52.814
All together, still alone


00:36:52.918 --> 00:36:57.321
What a city! Touch wood


00:37:01.160 --> 00:37:03.060
5, 6, 7, 8 avenues


00:37:03.128 --> 00:37:04.857
Million billion legs and shoes


00:37:04.963 --> 00:37:06.726
Lots of colours, dollars dollars


00:37:06.865 --> 00:37:08.332
sense of pidlee poo


00:37:08.400 --> 00:37:10.300
Breakfast is for all day


00:37:10.402 --> 00:37:12.131
Straight and gay they all sway


00:37:12.204 --> 00:37:15.401
and Lexington, and Madison,
it's all so ooh!


00:37:15.474 --> 00:37:19.205
Frappuccino


00:37:19.244 --> 00:37:22.907
Mochaccino


00:37:23.015 --> 00:37:27.418
Cappuccino...


00:37:39.932 --> 00:37:41.331
You gotto say balle
balle while you do that...


00:37:41.433 --> 00:37:43.094
Balle balle balle balle!


00:37:44.903 --> 00:37:46.768
Aunty... you're not eating


00:37:46.905 --> 00:37:47.872
food's not good?


00:37:50.342 --> 00:37:52.003
This parantha is really good...


00:37:52.277 --> 00:37:54.541
lt's Mexican food... Quesadilla...


00:37:54.780 --> 00:37:57.010
Whatever it is... it's good!


00:37:57.516 --> 00:37:58.278
What's that? What did she say?


